Package: udmabuf-import-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Description: out-of-tree dma-buf importer for udmabuf (DKMS)
 Standalone out-of-tree kernel module providing the udmabuf dma-buf import
 ioctls (UDMABUF_ATTACH / UDMABUF_DETACH / UDMABUF_GET_MAP) on a dedicated
 /dev/udmabuf_import misc device. It imports an external dma-buf (a CPU buffer
 via udmabuf+memfd, or GPU memory via the NVIDIA driver) and shares its DMA
 addresses with userspace.
 .
 The ioctls originated as a patch to the in-tree, built-in udmabuf driver
 (CONFIG_UDMABUF=y), which forced a full kernel rebuild. They are additive and
 self-contained, using only exported dma-buf core APIs, so they are shipped
 here as their own module. Built and installed via DKMS, it rebuilds
 automatically on kernel updates with no custom kernel required.
